              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Easy Attendance Marking</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary">Mark attendance for each class with just a few clicks. Navigate between dates effortlessly.</p>
          </div>
          
