            <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary">Calculate safe bunks with what-if scenarios. Plan your attendance strategically.</p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="card p-6">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-info-soft flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-info" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
                <line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"></line>
                <line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"></line>
                <line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"></line>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Calendar View</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary">Visual attendance calendar with color-coded days for quick overview.</p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="card p-6">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-purple-soft flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-purple" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">100% Private</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary">All data stored locally in your browser. No account required, complete privacy.</p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="card p-6">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-cyan-soft flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-cyan" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
                <line x1="12" y1="18" x2="12.01" y2="18"></line>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Mobile Friendly</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary">Works perfectly on desktop and mobile. Track attendance anywhere, anytime.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA Section -->
    <section class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 border-t border-border">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Ready to Take Control of Your Attendance?</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary mb-8">Join thousands of students using MyAttendTracker to track their attendance and stay on top of their academic goals.</p>
